    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 04</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Apply industrial-grade stretch-film weatherproofing over the entire crate assembly to create a moisture barrier. This protective layer shields against the heavy monsoon conditions common on the route, preventing water seepage and humidity damage that could ruin wood finishes and paper documents during the journey.</p>
